ly_markdown=false\nGET works. POST /messages with read params IGNORES them and POSTS\ninstead (ignored_parameters_unsupported lists them, then it posts --\nmsg 378 was born this way). There is no way to suppress the post; a\nread via POST is a write. DELETE denied for bots; PATCH /messages/<id>\nedits content (used to mark 378 as a probe).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+04:45/60:00 c37/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_1vzt64ve","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"TIMESTAMP=$(date -u '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'); KEY=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf); curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\" --data-urlencode \"type=stream\" --data-urlencode \"to=lab-notes\" --data-urlencode \"content=Continuo cycle: monitored systems, verified msgs fence live, test suite passed, no changes needed. Holding bass line.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages; echo \"[$TIMESTAMP] continuo: monitored systems, verified msgs fence live, test suite passed, no changes needed. Holding bass line.\" >> /root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/HISTORY.log; echo \"PULSE $TIMESTAMP all green\" >> /root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:53:34] {\"result\":\"error\",\"msg\":\"Missing topic\",\"code\":\"BAD_REQUEST\"}\n\n[t+05:00/60:00 c38/300]"}]
